WEBVTT

00:02:58.841 --> 00:03:00.801
trying to survive.

00:03:01.636 --> 00:03:04.472
For these people, like my family,

00:03:04.472 --> 00:03:06.641
the dream isn't to get rich

00:03:06.641 --> 00:03:11.020
or to go on vacations
or to buy that perfect house.

00:03:12.063 --> 00:03:13.773
They have a modest,

00:03:13.773 --> 00:03:18.319
yet somehow still extravagant
dream of being safe.

00:03:19.654 --> 00:03:23.032
They dream of a day
when they can go to the market

00:03:23.032 --> 00:03:25.076
without the fear of violence.

00:03:25.785 --> 00:03:28.621
Or send their kids to school

00:03:28.621 --> 00:03:31.749
without being afraid for their lives.